Here's the problem file for switching on the coffee machine:

```pddl
(define (problem switch_coffee_machine_problem)
  (:domain robot3)
  (:objects
    robot3 - robot
    CoffeeMachine - object
    Mug - object
    CounterTop - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot3 CounterTop)
    (at-location Mug CoffeeMachine)
    (not (inaction robot3))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (switch-on robot3 CoffeeMachine)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.